WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.474 --> 00:00:06.608
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD EVENING AND

00:00:06.609 --> 00:00:09.077
WELCOME TO COME TELL MARK

00:00:09.078 --> 00:00:10.045
TUCKER CARLSON TONIGHT.

00:00:10.046 --> 00:00:10.779
THE DEMOCRATIC PARTY WANTS TO

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:15.283
RUN THE UNITED STATES.

00:00:15.284 --> 00:00:17.886
BOTH PORTLAND.

00:00:17.887 --> 00:00:18.320
NO.

