THEY WANT TO RUN THE ENTIRE

00:00:19.889 --> 00:00:21.723
THING.

00:00:21.724 --> 00:00:26.862
ALL 50 STATES, ALL 3100

00:00:26.863 --> 00:00:28.363
COUNTIES, ALL 320 MILLION

00:00:28.364 --> 00:00:28.697
PEOPLE.

00:00:28.698 --> 00:00:30.031
PROGRESSIVES WANT COMPLETE

00:00:30.032 --> 00:00:31.133
CONTROL OF ALL OF THAT.

00:00:31.134 --> 00:00:32.434
VERY MUCH, INCLUDING YOUR

00:00:32.435 --> 00:00:32.868
NEIGHBORHOOD.

00:00:32.869 --> 00:00:35.036
THAT IS THEIR GOAL IN THE COMING

00:00:35.037 --> 00:00:35.403
ELECTION.

00:00:35.404 --> 00:00:36.471
WHAT WILL HAPPEN IF THEY ACHIEVE

00:00:36.472 --> 00:00:36.838
THAT GOAL?

00:00:36.839 --> 00:00:40.842
WE DON'T HAVE TO ACT DUMB I

00:00:40.843 --> 00:00:41.710
GUESS.

00:00:41.711 --> 00:00:43.478
WE CAN ASSESS THE CITY THEY

00:00:43.479 --> 00:00:44.179
ALREADY HAVE CONTROL OVER AND

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.715
HAVE FOR A LONG TIME.

00:00:46.716 --> 00:00:48.083
IF THERE IS ANY COUNTRY THAT YOU

00:00:48.084 --> 00:00:50.685
WOULD LIKE TO RUN, IT WOULD HAVE

00:00:50.686 --> 00:00:51.653
TO BE SAN FRANCISCO.

00:00:51.654 --> 00:00:53.288
IT IS A STUNNINGLY BEAUTIFUL.

00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:54.856
IT'S A PERFECT CLIMATE.

00:00:54.857 --> 00:00:56.892
IT HAS SOLID INFRASTRUCTURE.

00:00:56.893 --> 00:00:57.859
THERE IS A WELL EDUCATED

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:58.527
POPULATION.

00:00:58.528 --> 00:01:01.263
BUT MORE THAN ANYTHING, IT HAS A

00:01:01.264 --> 00:01:01.696
LOT OF MONEY.

00:01:01.697 --> 00:01:02.397
SAN FRANCISCO IS ONE OF THE

00:01:02.398 --> 00:01:05.200
RICHEST PLACES IN THE WORLD.

00:01:05.201 --> 00:01:07.702
HOW COULD YOU SCREW THAT UP?

00:01:07.703 --> 00:01:10.872
AND YET, TAKE A LOOK AT WHAT THE

00:01:10.873 --> 00:01:12.507
LEFT HAS DONE WITH

00:01:12.508 --> 00:01:12.941
SAN FRANCISCO.

00:01:12.942 --> 00:01:14.242
&gt;&gt; AND SOME SAN FRANCISCO

00:01:14.243 --> 00:01:14.976
NEIGHBORHOODS, HOLD YOUR NOSE

00:01:14.977 --> 00:01:15.911
AND WATCH YOUR STEP.

00:01:15.912 --> 00:01:17.979
&gt;&gt; YOU SEE PEOPLE LYING ON THE

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:18.313
STREETS.

00:01:18.314 --> 00:01:20.916
YOU SEE PEOPLE PASS OUT ON THE

00:01:20.917 --> 00:01:21.683
STREETS.

00:01:21.684 --> 00:01:23.385
YOU ARE SEEN PEOPLE SHOOT UP.

00:01:23.386 --> 00:01:25.520
YOU ARE SEEING PEOPLE EAT OUT OF

00:01:25.521 --> 00:01:25.954
GARBAGE CANS.

00:01:25.955 --> 00:01:27.455
&gt;&gt; TAKE A LOOK.

00:01:27.456 --> 00:01:29.090
PEOPLE ARE DUMPING THEIR USED

00:01:29.091 --> 00:01:30.058
SYRINGES INTO THE STREET.

00:01:30.059 --> 00:01:32.260
PILES LIKE THIS ARE COMMONPLACE.

00:01:32.261 --> 00:01:33.228
MOST OF THE NEEDLES ARE HANDED

00:01:33.229 --> 00:01:40.235
OUT BY THE SAN FRANCISCO PUBLIC

00:01:40.236 --> 00:01:40.569
HEALTH.

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:41.970
WITH NO RELIABLE WAY TO GET THEM

00:01:41.971 --> 00:01:46.841
ALL BACK, THE CITY IS SPENDING

00:01:46.842 --> 00:01:48.343
$750,000 TO HIRE PEOPLE TO PICK

00:01:48.344 --> 00:01:50.078
UP THE NEEDLES.

00:01:50.079 --> 00:01:54.316
SOME 10,000 EVERY MONTH.

00:01:54.317 --> 00:01:54.916
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BOMBAY, INDIA

00:01:54.917 --> 00:01:56.051
DOESN'T LOOK LIKE THAT.

00:01:56.052 --> 00:01:58.453
YOU WOULD THINK IT WOULD BE

00:01:58.454 --> 00:01:59.487
AFFORDABLE, BUT IT'S THE

00:01:59.488 --> 00:01:59.888
OPPOSITE.

00:01:59.889 --> 00:02:01.089
AVERAGE RENT FOR AN APARTMENT IN

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.825
SAN FRANCISCO RIGHT NOW IS ABOUT

00:02:03.826 --> 00:02:04.159
$4,000.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:06.861
THE CITY WORKS ONLY FOR THE

00:02:06.862 --> 00:02:09.097
EXTREMELY RICH.

00:02:09.098 --> 00:02:10.265
NORMAL PEOPLE, THERE'S NO PLACE

00:02:10.266 --> 00:02:10.932
FOR THEM.

00:02:10.933 --> 00:02:13.435
WANT TO RAISE A FAMILY IN THE

00:02:13.436 --> 00:02:13.735
CITY?

00:02:13.736 --> 00:02:14.102
GOOD LUCK.

00:02:14.103 --> 00:02:16.605
SAN FRANCISCO NOW HAS MORE

00:02:16.606 --> 00:02:17.372
DAY CARE SPACES FOR ANIMALS THAT

00:02:17.373 --> 00:02:18.440
IT DOES FOR BABIES.

00:02:18.441 --> 00:02:19.841
IT IS LITERALLY A CITY WITHOUT A

00:02:19.842 --> 00:02:20.175
FUTURE.

00:02:20.176 --> 00:02:23.378
IT'S PEOPLE CAN'T AFFORD TO

00:02:23.379 --> 00:02:25.347
REPRODUCE.

00:02:25.348 --> 00:02:26.081
AND SAN FRANCISCO ISN'T ALONE.

00:02:26.082 --> 00:02:28.650
THE REST OF CALIFORNIA'S SINGLE

00:02:28.651 --> 00:02:31.653
PARTY CITIES ARE FOLLOWING SUIT.

00:02:31.654 --> 00:02:32.988
LOS ANGELES, FOR EXAMPLE, IS NOW

00:02:32.989 --> 00:02:33.688
BIGGER THAN ANY CITY IN THE

00:02:33.689 --> 00:02:38.226
ENTIRE STATE OF VERMONT.

00:02:38.227 --> 00:02:38.927
IT'S FILTHY ENCAMPMENTS ARE

00:02:38.928 --> 00:02:43.698
FILLED WITH DISEASES.

00:02:43.699 --> 00:02:44.699
MORE THAN WAR-TORN COUNTRIES.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:46.368
&gt;&gt; OVER TIME, SQUALOR BUILDS UP

00:02:46.369 --> 00:02:47.869
ON THE STREETS, WITH RATS

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:50.438
FEASTING ON ROTTING FOOD MIXED

00:02:50.439 --> 00:02:52.474
WITH SEWAGE AND USED SYRINGES.

00:02:52.475 --> 00:02:56.211
RATS AND FLEAS, TYPHUS TRAVELED

00:02:56.212 --> 00:02:58.446
THROUGH THE STREETS.

00:02:58.447 --> 00:03:00.582
THE ATTORNEY, WHO WORKS WAY UP

00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:03.184
ON THE SIXTH FLOOR OF CITY HALL,

00:03:03.185 --> 00:03:03.618
GOT INFECTED.

00:03:03.619 --> 00:03:05.320
&gt;&gt; I FELT LIKE I WAS GOING TO

00:03:05.321 --> 00:03:05.587
DIE.

00:03:05.588 --> 00:03:07.956
&gt;&gt; GREENWOOD SAID THAT THE CITY

00:03:07.957 --> 00:03:10.659
HAS ALWAYS HAD RATS, BUT WHAT

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:11.893
HASN'T CHANGED IS WHAT'S AROUND

00:03:11.894 --> 00:03:12.627
IT.

00:03:12.628 --> 00:03:14.262
&gt;&gt; THE HOMELESS POPULATION HAS

00:03:14.263 --> 00:03:15.697
MOVED CLOSER AND CLOSER.

00:03:15.698 --> 00:03:17.132
THEY SURROUND THE BUILDING.

00:03:17.133 --> 00:03:19.634
SO, AS FOLKS WALK TO WORK AND

00:03:19.635 --> 00:03:20.335
BACK, THEY ARE WALKING THROUGH

00:03:20.336 --> 00:03:23.772
ROTTING FOOD, RAW SEWAGE.

00:03:23.773 --> 00:03:26.041
&gt;&gt; Tucker: TYPHUS?

00:03:26.042 --> 00:03:26.608
WHAT COUNTRY IS THIS?

00:03:26.609 --> 00:03:28.977
WHO DID THIS?

00:03:28.978 --> 00:03:31.079
THEY DID THE SAME THING TO

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:31.479
SACRAMENTO.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.147
THAT'S THE STATE CAPITAL OF

00:03:32.148 --> 00:03:33.815
CALIFORNIA.

00:03:33.816 --> 00:03:36.618
IT HAS GOTTEN SO OUT OF CONTROL

00:03:36.619 --> 00:03:37.619
THAT ORDINARY PEOPLE CAN BARELY

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:38.019
LIVE THERE.

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.287
&gt;&gt; I JUST WANT TO TELL YOU WHAT

00:03:39.288 --> 00:03:40.488
HAPPENS WHEN I GET TO WORK.

00:03:40.489 --> 00:03:42.924
I HAVE TO CLEAN UP THE AND OFF

00:03:42.925 --> 00:03:43.591
OF MY DOORSTEP.

00:03:43.592 --> 00:03:45.293
I HAVE TO CLEAN UP THE SYRINGES.

00:03:45.294 --> 00:03:46.928
I HAVE TO FIGHT OFF PEOPLE THAT

00:03:46.929 --> 00:03:48.663
PUSH THEIR WAY INTO MY SHOP THAT

00:03:48.664 --> 00:03:50.632
ARE HOMELESS AND ON DRUGS,

00:03:50.633 --> 00:03:52.267
BECAUSE YOU WON'T ARREST THEM

00:03:52.268 --> 00:03:53.068
FOR DRUG OFFENSES.

00:03:53.069 --> 00:03:56.104
I HAVE TO APOLOGIZE TO MY

00:03:56.105 --> 00:03:56.438
CLIENTS.

00:03:56.439 --> 00:03:57.639
SO I WANT TO KNOW WHAT YOU'RE

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.774
GOING TO DO FOR US, THE ONES

00:03:59.775 --> 00:04:00.909
THAT ARE UNHAPPY.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.277
YOU WANT TO MAKE IT A SANCTUARY

00:04:02.278 --> 00:04:02.844
STATE.

00:04:02.845 --> 00:04:04.679
YOU WANT TO MAKE IT COMFORTABLE

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.448
FOR EVERYONE EXCEPT FOR THE

00:04:06.449 --> 00:04:07.582
PEOPLE THAT WORK HARD AND HAVE

00:04:07.583 --> 00:04:09.884
TRIED THEIR HARDEST TO GET ALONG

00:04:09.885 --> 00:04:10.585
IN LIFE.

00:04:10.586 --> 00:04:11.820
WHY YOU SIT IN YOUR MILLION

00:04:11.821 --> 00:04:12.554
DOLLAR HOME AND YOU DON'T HAVE

00:04:12.555 --> 00:04:14.856
TO LOOK AT WHAT WE ARE LOOKING

00:04:14.857 --> 00:04:16.057
AT, THERE ARE HARDWORKING PEOPLE

00:04:16.058 --> 00:04:17.292
OUT THERE WHO HAVE TO DEAL WITH

00:04:17.293 --> 00:04:18.493
US ON A DAILY BASIS.

00:04:18.494 --> 00:04:20.462
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT'S A DISASTER,

00:04:20.463 --> 00:04:20.829
OBVIOUSLY.

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:23.598
AND YET, REMARKABLY, CITIES

00:04:23.599 --> 00:04:26.000
AROUND THE COUNTRY, ARE RACING

00:04:26.001 --> 00:04:27.168
TO COPY CALIFORNIA.

00:04:27.169 --> 00:04:27.936
WASHINGTON, D.C., IS NOW COVERED

00:04:27.937 --> 00:04:30.605
WITH TENTS AND FELT.

00:04:30.606 --> 00:04:31.272
DRIVE AROUND IF YOU DON'T

00:04:31.273 --> 00:04:35.610
BELIEVE IT.

00:04:35.611 --> 00:04:38.480
WE HAVE SEEN THIS BEFORE.

00:04:38.481 --> 00:04:40.115
FOR DECADES, AMERICANS FLED

00:04:40.116 --> 00:04:42.283
CITIES TO ESCAPE FROM CHAOS AND

00:04:42.284 --> 00:04:44.119
CRIME.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:49.057
FINALLY, IN THE 1990s, CRIME

00:04:49.058 --> 00:04:49.357
FELL.

00:04:49.358 --> 00:04:51.025
IT BECAME LIVABLE AGAIN.

00:04:51.026 --> 00:04:52.227
PROPERTY VALUES ROSE.

00:04:52.228 --> 00:04:54.195
POOR NEIGHBORHOODS GOT BETTER.

00:04:54.196 --> 00:04:55.597
EVERYONE BENEFITED, AND PEOPLE

00:04:55.598 --> 00:04:56.498
STARTED MOVING BACK.

00:04:56.499 --> 00:04:58.133
PLACES THAT HAD BEEN TREKKING

00:04:58.134 --> 00:04:58.767
FOR DECADES, PLACES LIKE

00:04:58.768 --> 00:05:00.935
WASHINGTON AND PHILADELPHIA,

00:05:00.936 --> 00:05:02.837
STARTED GROWING AGAIN.

00:05:02.838 --> 00:05:06.875
IT WAS A SUCCESS.

00:05:06.876 --> 00:05:09.744
BUT THAT IS GOING IN REVERSE NO

00:05:09.745 --> 00:05:12.213
NOW.

00:05:12.214 --> 00:05:13.047
AMONG AMERICAN'S SEVEN LARGEST

00:05:13.048 --> 00:05:13.748
CITIES, SAN FRANCISCO HAS THE

00:05:13.749 --> 00:05:17.318
HIGHEST PROPERTY LEVEL CRIME

00:05:17.319 --> 00:05:17.652
LEVELS.

00:05:17.653 --> 00:05:20.722
THERE ARE 70 CAR BREAK-INS EVERY

00:05:20.723 --> 00:05:23.858
SINGLE DAY.

00:05:23.859 --> 00:05:31.199
THAT IS ENABLED BY RAPID.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:34.269
ACROSS THE COUNTRY, AMERICA'S

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.304
LIBERAL CITIES SIDE WITH THE

00:05:36.305 --> 00:05:37.639
CRIMINALS.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:40.275
IN DALLAS COUNTY, TEXAS, FOR

00:05:40.276 --> 00:05:41.709
EXAMPLE, THE DISTRICT ATTORNEY

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:43.611
THERE IS REFUSING TO CRIMINALLY

00:05:43.612 --> 00:05:47.816
PROSECUTE THEFTS OF LESS THAN

00:05:47.817 --> 00:05:50.218
$750.

00:05:50.219 --> 00:05:51.186
HE DECIDES THAT THEFT WAS OF

00:05:51.187 --> 00:05:54.456
NECESSARY ITEMS.

00:05:54.457 --> 00:05:56.624
HE BELIEVES THAT AMERICAN

00:05:56.625 --> 00:05:57.158
LAW ENFORCEMENT IS

00:05:57.159 --> 00:06:01.229
"SYSTEMATICALLY RACIST."

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:01.896
SO, HE HAS STOPPED PROVIDING

00:06:01.897 --> 00:06:06.134
LAW ENFORCEMENT AT ALL.

00:06:06.135 --> 00:06:07.569
THAT IS A CATEGORY THAT INCLUDES

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:12.474
BURGLARY.

00:06:12.475 --> 00:06:13.541
NOT SO LOW-LEVEL IF YOU ARE THE

00:06:13.542 --> 00:06:31.926
VICTIM OF THAT.

00:06:31.927 --> 00:06:32.627
THEY ARE NOT HARD TO PREDICT.

00:06:32.628 --> 00:06:33.394
YOU KNOW EXACT WHAT IS GOING TO

00:06:33.395 --> 00:06:34.062
HAPPEN WHEN YOU GOVERN LIKE

00:06:34.063 --> 00:06:34.362
THIS.

00:06:34.363 --> 00:06:34.996
IN FACT, IT HAS HAPPENED.

00:06:34.997 --> 00:06:35.697
IN 2018, PHILADELPHIA HAD ITS

00:06:35.698 --> 00:06:36.331
HIGHEST MURDER RECORD IN A

00:06:36.332 --> 00:06:36.664
DECADE.

00:06:36.665 --> 00:06:37.398
IT HAS DRAMATICALLY SURGED IN A

00:06:37.399 --> 00:06:38.099
BUNCH OF DIFFERENT CITIES WITH

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:38.600
SIMILAR PROGRAMS.

00:06:38.601 --> 00:06:39.935
CHICAGO, BALTIMORE, WASHINGTON.

